WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.437
gopgext builds PostgreSQL

00:00:02.249 --> 00:00:03.557
extensions from plain

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:04.217
Go code with

00:00:04.029 --> 00:00:04.866
TinyGo

00:00:05.382 --> 00:00:06.148
Mark a Go

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.669
function with /

00:00:07.481 --> 00:00:09.061
/ gopgext

00:00:09.203 --> 00:00:10.299
function and it

00:00:10.111 --> 00:00:11.219
becomes a SQL

00:00:11.031 --> 00:00:11.785
function

00:00:11.924 --> 00:00:13.409
Packages cover foreign

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:14.188
data wrappers

00:00:14.271 --> 00:00:15.756
index access methods

00:00:15.827 --> 00:00:16.617
aggregates

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.079
hooks triggers and

00:00:17.891 --> 00:00:18.468
more

00:00:19.006 --> 00:00:20.079
The author warns

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:20.539
not to use

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:21.293
it in production

00:00:21.471 --> 00:00:22.083
