00:00:21.895 --> 00:00:23.168
generated code or

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:24.053
the Go runtime

00:00:23.864 --> 00:00:24.843
runs inside the

00:00:24.655 --> 00:00:26.034
database server and

00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:26.824
can crash it

00:00:26.718 --> 00:00:27.873
or corrupt data

00:00:28.406 --> 00:00:30.139
PostgreSQL extensions

00:00:29.951 --> 00:00:31.106
in Go gopgext

00:00:30.918 --> 00:00:32.981
builds PostgreSQL extensions

00:00:32.793 --> 00:00:33.606
from plain Go

00:00:33.418 --> 00:00:33.948
code

00:00:34.066 --> 00:00:35.115
using TinyGo

00:00:35.646 --> 00:00:36.660
Full story on

